  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "辛味が　ある　食材。サンドウィッチには　欠かせない　野菜。脂が多い　食材との　相性が　よい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "매운맛이 나는 식재료. 샌드위치에 빠지지 않는 채소다. 느끼한 식재료와 궁합이 잘 맞는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "帶有辣味的食材。是三明治中不可或缺的蔬菜。和油脂多的食材非常搭配。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût épicé. Un légume indispensable à tout bon Sandwich. Se marie bien avec les ingrédients plutôt gras.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Diese scharfe Zutat darf auf keinem Sandwich fehlen. Sie harmoniert besonders gut mit fettreichen Zutaten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Esta hortaliza de sabor picante no puede faltar en ningún bocadillo. Combina especialmente bien con ingredientes con alto contenido graso.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente piccante. Questa verdura, che non può mancare in un panino, si abbina bene con ingredienti molto grassi.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This spicy veggie is indispensable to many sandwiches. It goes well with rich ingredients.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
